@baseUrl = http://localhost:5086
# Replace each Id with an existing Id from the corresponding List response.
@carId = 1
@employeeId = 1
@administratorId = 1
@operationTypeId = 1
@operationId = 1

### Cars - 200: value.results and paging metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/list/1/10

### Cars - 200: next page (may be empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/list/2/10

### Cars - 200: default page=1, pageSize=10
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/list

### Cars - 200: normalized to 1/10
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/list/0/0

### Cars - 200: normalized to 1/10
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/list/-1/-1

### Cars - 200: empty results for the sample database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/list/2147483647/10

### Cars - 200: value contains DTO; choose Id from List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/get/{{carId}}

### Cars - 404 if this Id does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/get/2147483647

### Cars - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/get/0

### Cars - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/get/-1

### Cars - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cars/get/

